  "What a source has to speak": "ソースが話すべきもの",
  "What language the app is in, and what language film and show descriptions are fetched in.": "アプリの表示言語と、映画や番組の説明を取得する言語。",
  "What sits behind the app": "アプリの背後に置くもの",
